   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">FAO Project TCP/ARM/3202 (08/VI/ARM/212): Input supply to vulnerable populations under the Initiative on Soaring Food Prices. Project objectives: To maintain livelihoods and food security of the most vulnerable households of the food insecure districts of Armenia, affected by the difficult 2007/8 winter as well as the recent soaring food prices crisis.</rdf:li>
